<title>JAPAN: Tachibana Syokai - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Tachibana Syokai - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 44.15		vs	   41.01</p>
<p> Operating	  682 million	 vs	  442 million</p>
<p> Current	    596 million	 vs	  321 million</p>
<p> Net		  241 million	 vs	  110 million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.70 yen	  vs	    6.71 yen</p>
<p> Shares		16 million	 vs	   16 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Tachibana Syokai Ltd is one of the oldest sales agents for Mitsubishi Electric Corp.</p>
</text>
